# Quest drops (mod-quest-drops): Graverobbers (358) asks for 8 Embalming Ichors, which Rot Hide
# Graverobbers drop at 40%. With the module every one of them has one while the quest needs it: five
# kills, five Ichors (at 40%, five of five would happen about once in a hundred tries). The character
# goes to each one's spawn (a graverobber called over from 45 yards away died out of looting reach in
# 1.0.340's and 1.0.342's tests: the core lets go of a corpse past 5.5 yards without a word).
cmd .levelup 9
cmd .quest add 358
go 0 2515.8 538.4 34.6
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
go 0 2525.4 491.6 34.5
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
go 0 2560.5 553.2 14.5
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
go 0 2482.2 465.7 41.2
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
go 0 2449.1 480.4 44.7
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
# Out of the fight, away from the graverobbers, so the character can log out (the realm keeps one in
# combat: 1.0.345's test was still fighting the next one by the spawn).
go 0 1676.7 1678.3 121.7
cmd .combatstop
wait 2
